        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-2" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="没有公网ip" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="100" x="70" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-8" edge="1" parent="1" source="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-3" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="1.在终端查看ipconfig，默认网关就是路由器登录地址。以下是常见的内网IP：&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;10.0.0.0&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ~ 10.255.255.255&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A类 最大&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;172.16.0.0&amp;nbsp; ~ 172.31.255.255&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; B类 中等&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;192.168.0.0 ~ 192.168.255.255&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;C类 最常见&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;100.64.0.0&amp;nbsp; ~ 100.127.255.255&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;运营商大内网专用&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;127.0.0.0&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;~ 127.255.255.255&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;本机回环地址（localhost）&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="420" x="240" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-7" edge="1" parent="1" source="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-6" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="2.登录进去，找到虚拟转发器或则是端口转发&lt;br&gt;填写要开放的端口+电脑内网IP+端口【没实操过】" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="270" x="740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="HDuTr-rBornGhjvDSju1-6" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/jpeg,;" value="" vertex="1">
